  <section class="static-page__section">
    <h2>7. Rent</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        A Rent is a temporary exclusive hold: for the rental period you
        hold the license and nobody else can buy or rent the template.
      </li>
      <li>
        The rental ends automatically at the end of the period. It does
        not renew and nothing is charged afterwards.
      </li>
      <li>
        If you Buy the same template while the Rent is active, the unused
        value of the Rent is credited toward the purchase.
      </li>
      <li>
        When a Rent ends without a Buy, your license ends, client preview
        links stop showing the template, and it returns to the catalog.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

